{"story":{"id":"event-infernals-2150","title":{"zh":"神秘开采站","en":"A Mysterious Station"},"category":"stories","kind":"event","image":"art/b5b6c7440ae71484e037.webp","start":"infernals.2151","chapters":12,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"进入该恒星系后，我方舰队遭遇一群自动化子个体的短暂抵抗，迅速将其消灭后，我们得以近距离勘察外星开采站。\n\n尽管外面有大量修补痕迹，但该设施仍在运行。在试图进入其中一个停靠舱时，我们与一个未知外星物种取得了联系。尽管有语言障碍，但可以确认该装置正是影响[event_target:situation_red_giant_target_shortterm.GetStarName]的次空间隧道的源头。\n\n目前，我们正全力建立沟通，或许能够通过外交途径解决问题。但若是失败，我们可能不得不考虑更直接的方式，即登陆设施或直接摧毁","en":"Upon entering the system, our vessels encountered limited resistance from a group of automated drones. These were swiftly neutralized, allowing for a closer examination of the alien station.\n\nThe structure remains operational, though its hull bears the marks o"},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"infernals.2151","parent":"n0","via":{"group":"c16451","hooks":["immediate"],"when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"exists","arg":"event_target:lusus_miner_station@root","scope":"","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"is_same_value","arg":"prevprev","scope":"fromfromfrom.solar_system/event_target:lusus_miner_station@root/solar_system","value":true}]]],"kind":"entry","source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:5543","triggers":[{"zh":"歼灭舰队时","en":"When a fleet is destroyed"}]},"children":["n2","n3","n4","n5"]},"n2":{"doc":"special_projects:INF_ORIGIN_RED_GIANT_PARLAY","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"infernals.2151.a","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:5605"},"children":["n6"]},"n3":{"doc":"special_projects:INF_ORIGIN_RED_GIANT_BOARD_STATION","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"infernals.2151.a","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:5611"},"children":["n7"]},"n4":{"ref":"n3","doc":"special_projects:INF_ORIGIN_RED_GIANT_BOARD_STATION","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"infernals.2151.b","optionIndex":1,"kind":"option","source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:5638"}},"n5":{"ref":"n2","doc":"special_projects:INF_ORIGIN_RED_GIANT_PARLAY","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"infernals.2151.b","optionIndex":1,"kind":"option","source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:5644"}},"n6":{"doc":"infernals.2125","parent":"n2","via":{"hooks":["on_success"],"kind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_infernals.txt:207"},"children":["n8","n9","n10","n11","n12"]},"n7":{"doc":"infernals.2115","parent":"n3","via":{"hooks":["on_success"],"kind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_infernals.txt:179"},"children":["n13","n14","n15","n16","n17","n18","n19"]},"n8":{"doc":"infernals.2131","parent":"n6","via":{"option":"infernals.2125.a","optionIndex":0,"delay":[{"days":"30"}],"kind":"option","source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:4862"},"children":["n20"]},"n9":{"ref":"n8","doc":"infernals.2131","parent":"n6","via":{"option":"infernals.2125.b","optionIndex":1,"delay":[{"days":"30"}],"kind":"option","source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:4881"}},"n10":{"doc":"infernals.2130","parent":"n6","via":{"option":"infernals.2115.c","optionIndex":2,"delay":[{"days":"30"}],"kind":"option","source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:4914"},"children":["n21"]},"n11":{"ref":"n10","doc":"infernals.2130","parent":"n6","via":{"option":"infernals.2125.c","optionIndex":3,"delay":[{"days":"30"}],"kind":"option","source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:4936"}},"n12":{"doc":"infernals.2135","parent":"n6","via":{"option":"infernals.2125.d","optionIndex":4,"delay":[{"days":"30"}],"kind":"option","source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:4945"},"children":["n22","n23","n24"]},"n13":{"doc":"infernals.2121","parent":"n7","via":{"option":"infernals.2115.a","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:4507"},"children":[]},"n14":{"ref":"n6","doc":"infernals.2125","parent":"n7","via":{"option":"infernals.2115.b","optionIndex":1,"delay":[{"days":"20"}],"kind":"option","source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:4526"}},"n15":{"ref":"n10","doc":"infernals.2130","parent":"n7","via":{"option":"infernals.2115.c","optionIndex":2,"delay":[{"days":"30"}],"kind":"option","source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:4560"}},"n16":{"ref":"n10","doc":"infernals.2130","parent":"n7","via":{"option":"infernals.2115.d","optionIndex":3,"delay":[{"days":"30"}],"kind":"option","source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:4585"}},"n17":{"ref":"n6","doc":"infernals.2125","parent":"n7","via":{"option":"infernals.2115.e","optionIndex":4,"delay":[{"days":"15"}],"kind":"option","source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:4598"}},"n18":{"ref":"n10","doc":"infernals.2130","parent":"n7","via":{"option":"infernals.2115.f","optionIndex":5,"delay":[{"days":"30"}],"kind":"option","source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:4615"}},"n19":{"ref":"n10","doc":"infernals.2130","parent":"n7","via":{"option":"infernals.2115.g","optionIndex":6,"delay":[{"days":"30"}],"kind":"option","source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:4650"}},"n20":{"doc":"infernals.2140","parent":"n8","via":{"delay":[{"months":"24"}],"hooks":["immediate"],"kind":"delay","source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:4997"},"children":["n25"]},"n21":{"ref":"n20","doc":"infernals.2140","parent":"n10","via":{"delay":[{"months":"24"}],"hooks":["immediate"],"kind":"delay","source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:4962"}},"n22":{"ref":"n10","doc":"infernals.2130","parent":"n12","via":{"option":"infernals.2135.c","optionIndex":2,"delay":[{"days":"30"}],"kind":"option","source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:5134"}},"n23":{"ref":"n10","doc":"infernals.2130","parent":"n12","via":{"option":"infernals.2115.f","optionIndex":3,"delay":[{"days":"30"}],"kind":"option","source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:5151"}},"n24":{"ref":"n10","doc":"infernals.2130","parent":"n12","via":{"option":"infernals.2115.g","optionIndex":4,"delay":[{"days":"30"}],"kind":"option","source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:5186"}},"n25":{"doc":"infernals.2145","parent":"n20","via":{"option":"infernals.2140.a","optionIndex":0,"delay":[{"days":"30"}],"kind":"option","source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:5258"},"children":["n26"]},"n26":{"doc":"infernals.2160","parent":"n25","via":{"delay":[{"months":"12"}],"hooks":["after"],"kind":"delay","source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:5507"},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"infernals.2151","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"神秘开采站","en":"A Mysterious Station"},"texts":[{"zh":"进入该恒星系后，我方舰队遭遇一群自动化子个体的短暂抵抗，迅速将其消灭后，我们得以近距离勘察外星开采站。\n\n尽管外面有大量修补痕迹，但该设施仍在运行。在试图进入其中一个停靠舱时，我们与一个未知外星物种取得了联系。尽管有语言障碍，但可以确认该装置正是影响[event_target:situation_red_giant_target_shortterm.GetStarName]的次空间隧道的源头。\n\n目前，我们正全力建立沟通，或许能够通过外交途径解决问题。但若是失败，我们可能不得不考虑更直接的方式，即登陆设施或直接摧毁。但在未彻底掌握其目的之前，贸然采取武力行动可能对恒星构成极大风险。","en":"Upon entering the system, our vessels encountered limited resistance from a group of automated drones. These were swiftly neutralized, allowing for a closer examination of the alien station.\n\nThe structure remains operational, though its hull bears the marks of extensive patchwork repairs. Attempting to access one of its docking bays, we made contact with a previously unknown alien species. Though linguistic barriers remain, we have confirmed that this installation is the origin of the tunnels affecting [event_target:situation_red_giant_target_shortterm.GetStarName].\n\nEfforts are now underway to establish communications. A diplomatic resolution may be possible. Failing that, we may be forced to consider more direct methods, boarding the facility or destroying it outright. However, without a thorough understanding of its purpose, such actions may carry significant risk to our star."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/b5b6c7440ae71484e037.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"infernals.2151.a","label":{"zh":"翻译其语言。","en":"Translate their language."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"special_projects:INF_ORIGIN_RED_GIANT_PARLAY","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:5605","story":"event-infernals-2150"},{"target":"special_projects:INF_ORIGIN_RED_GIANT_BOARD_STATION","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:5611","story":"event-infernals-2150"}],"terminal":false},{"key":"infernals.2151.b","label":{"zh":"强行进入开采站。","en":"Board the station by force."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"special_projects:INF_ORIGIN_RED_GIANT_BOARD_STATION","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:5638","story":"event-infernals-2150"},{"target":"special_projects:INF_ORIGIN_RED_GIANT_PARLAY","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:5644","story":"event-infernals-2150"}],"terminal":false},{"key":"infernals.2151.c","label":{"zh":"摧毁开采站。","en":"Destroy the station."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/infernals_1_events.txt","line":5569},"names":{"event_target:situation_red_giant_target_shortterm.GetStarName":{"zh":"这颗恒星","en":"the star"}}},{"id":"special_projects:INF_ORIGIN_RED_GIANT_PARLAY","kind":"project","title":{"zh":"紧急外星语言学研究","en":"Emergency Xenolinguistics"},"texts":[{"zh":"开采站的居民控制着正在摧毁我们恒星的亚空间虹吸装置。我们必须建立沟通，确保他们配合解决此问题。","en":"The station's inhabitants control the subspace siphon that is destroying our star. We must establish communications to ensure their cooperation in solving this issue."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/b3a6a365bcc899028f4d.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"infernals.2125","kind":"project","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_infernals.txt:207","hooks":["on_success"],"story":"event-infernals-2150"}],"source":{"file":"common/special_projects/00_projects_infernals.txt","line":191}},{"id":"infernals.2125","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"外星谈判","en":"Alien Negotiations"},"texts":[{"zh":"历经漫长而艰辛的研究，我们终于研发出基础翻译装置，得以与开采站的居民进行交流。\n\n这座开采站已经运行了数代，在气态巨行星之间不断迁移，通过亚空间虹吸装置从遥远恒星中抽取能量，为生命维持系统与强大跃迁引擎的运转供能。\n\n外星居民并未完全理解系统机制，也未察觉他们的虹吸目标为恒星，最终致恒星毁灭。\n\n尽管有些困惑，但他们迫切希望离开这里，并承诺将自身的知识与技术传授给我们，换取一个安全的居住地与孕育后代的家园。","en":"After a lengthy and difficult process, we have a rudimentary translator that can communicate with station inhabitants.\n\nThe station has been operating for generations, moving from gas giant to gas giant, using the subspace siphon to extract energy from distant stars to power their life support and powerful jump drive.\n\nThe aliens do not fully understand the systems they are operating and did not realize that their siphoning targeted stars and eventually destroyed them.\n\nDespite their confusion, they seem eager to leave the station. They have promised to teach us what they know in exchange for a safe place to live and raise their young."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/63f1fc47a1837cd1c767.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"infernals.2125.a","label":{"zh":"为他们提供庇护。","en":"Provide them with sanctuary."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"在[this.GetName]生成了400 £pop£ 人口","en":"400 £pop£ Pops are created in [this.GetName]"}],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"infernals.2131","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","delay":[{"days":"30"}],"source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:4862","story":"event-infernals-2150"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"is_homicidal","arg":"yes","scope":"owner","value":false}]]},{"key":"infernals.2125.b","label":{"zh":"赠予飞船让其自寻出路。","en":"Give them a ship to find their own path."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"infernals.2131","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","delay":[{"days":"30"}],"source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:4881","story":"event-infernals-2150"}],"terminal":false},{"key":"infernals.2115.c","label":{"zh":"奴役他们。","en":"Enslave them."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"在[this.GetName]生成了400 £pop£ 人口","en":"400 £pop£ Pops are created in [this.GetName]"}],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"infernals.2130","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","delay":[{"days":"30"}],"source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:4914","story":"event-infernals-2150"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"allows_slavery","arg":"yes","scope":"owner","value":true}]]},{"key":"infernals.2125.c","label":{"zh":"远程排放开采站废气。","en":"Remotely vent the station."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"infernals.2130","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","delay":[{"days":"30"}],"source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:4936","story":"event-infernals-2150"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"allows_purge","arg":"yes","scope":"owner","value":true}]]},{"key":"infernals.2125.d","label":{"zh":"允许他们自行评判我们。","en":"Allow them to make their own judgment of us."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"infernals.2135","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","delay":[{"days":"30"}],"source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:4945","story":"event-infernals-2150"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_pacifist","value":true,"label":{"zh":"和平主义","en":"Pacifist"}}]]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/infernals_1_events.txt","line":4823},"names":{"this.GetName":{"zh":"这艘舰船","en":"the ship"}}},{"id":"infernals.2131","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"亚空间采矿作业","en":"Subspace Mining Operation"},"texts":[{"zh":"开采站从气态巨行星虹吸氢气，通过亚空间隧道输送至恒星外层，引发氦聚变反应，释放出过剩能量，再将能量转化为结晶熵，为站点供能。\n\n站中居民只能口述设备的运作机制，且信息未必准确。他们在数千年前便与母星失联，或许是因为其文明已然崩溃或被消灭。随着校准误差累积与设备老化，虹吸过程愈发不稳，如今甚至可能摧毁[event_target:situation_red_giant_target_shortterm.GetStarName]。\n\n借助他们古老的技术，我们有可能将这一进程逆转，但难度极高。另一个可行的方案是诱导恒星发生新星爆发，使大量矿藏暴露出来，成为方便开采的资源。","en":"The station siphons hydrogen from a gas giant and channels it through subspace into our star's shell. The resulting helium fusion releases excess energy, which is converted into Crystallized Entropy to power the station.\n\nThe inhabitants of the station retain only a warped oral tradition about its operations. They lost contact with their home civilization thousands of years ago, perhaps because that civilization collapsed or was destroyed. A buildup of calibration errors and equipment degradation has led to the increasingly unstable siphoning that now threatens to destroy [event_target:situation_red_giant_target_shortterm.GetStarName].\n\nWorking with their ancient technology we can reverse the process, but it will not be easy. Alternatively, forcing our star to go nova could expose countless deposits, transforming our heritage into a trove of exploitable resources."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/ea94f9f94d0479d037e0.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"infernals.2130.a","label":{"zh":"是时候开始了。","en":"It's time to get to work."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[{"target":"infernals.2140","kind":"delay","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"delay","delay":[{"months":"24"}],"source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:4997","hooks":["immediate"],"story":"event-infernals-2150"}],"source":{"file":"events/infernals_1_events.txt","line":4979},"sets":["red_giant_controlled_lusus_station","situation_red_giant_expansion_approach4"],"names":{"event_target:situation_red_giant_target_shortterm.GetStarName":{"zh":"这颗恒星","en":"the star"}}},{"id":"infernals.2140","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"稳定可能","en":"Prospect of Stability"},"texts":[{"zh":"经过艰苦卓绝的努力，我们现已完全掌控[event_target:situation_red_giant_target_shortterm.GetStarName]的命运。如果不加干预，它将以当前体积遵循自然生命周期运行。\n\n然而，那座古老破败的开采站已无法承受多次的重新配置。每一次调整都在透支其设施寿命。如今，我们面前只剩一个抉择：\n\n要么将恒星缩回原有规模；要么迫使其进一步膨胀，将整个恒星系化为容易开采的辽阔资源宝地。\n\n我们的[GetScientistPlural]将执行最后一次重新配置，在此之后，它唯一的结局便是被外力迅速拆解。","en":"After great effort, we now hold full control over the fate of [event_target:situation_red_giant_target_shortterm.GetStarName]. Left alone, it would follow its natural life cycle at its current size.\n\nBut the ancient and failing station cannot withstand repeated reconfigurations. Each adjustment strains the facility to its limits. Now, we have only one choice.\n\nWe can shrink the star back to its former size, or force it to expand, transforming the system into a vast field of easily harvested resources.\n\nOur [GetScientistPlural] will attempt one last reconfiguration. After that, the only way forward will be rapid disassembly, by external force."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/eb4bbc701c9bf528ec1d.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"infernals.2140.a","label":{"zh":"保持恒星当前状态。","en":"Fix the star in its current state."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"infernals.2145","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","delay":[{"days":"30"}],"source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:5258","story":"event-infernals-2150"}],"terminal":false,"sets":["situation_red_giant_stabilize_the_star"]},{"key":"infernals.2140.b","label":{"zh":"加速恒星膨胀。","en":"Accelerate the star's expansion."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"不可避免地让[event_target:situation_red_giant_target_shortterm.GetStarName]膨胀。","en":"Inevitably grows [event_target:situation_red_giant_target_shortterm.GetStarName]."}],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false,"sets":["situation_red_giant_continue_siphoning"],"clears":["situation_red_giant_stabilize_the_star"]},{"key":"infernals.2140.c","label":{"zh":"恢复恒星常态。","en":"Return the star to normal."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"不可避免地让[event_target:situation_red_giant_target_shortterm.GetStarName]缩小。","en":"Inevitably shrinks [event_target:situation_red_giant_target_shortterm.GetStarName]."}],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false,"sets":["situation_red_giant_reverse_inflation"],"clears":["situation_red_giant_stabilize_the_star"]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/infernals_1_events.txt","line":5222},"sets":["red_giant_prospect","situation_red_giant_stabilize_the_star"],"names":{"event_target:situation_red_giant_target_shortterm.GetStarName":{"zh":"这颗恒星","en":"the star"}}},{"id":"infernals.2145","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"达成稳定","en":"Stability Achieved"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们完全掌控恒星的体积与能量波动后，[Target.GetStarName]终于彻底稳定下来。未来数百万年内，它都将保持当前状态，我们的人民也得以在母星系重享稳定与可预测的生活。\n\n恒星的膨胀虽对基础设施管理造成显著影响，但我们已能化危为机，既能充分利用其增强的能量输出，又能保持在恒星系内稳定生存。","en":"With complete control achieved over our star's fluctuating size and energy, [Target.GetStarName] has fully stabilized. It will remain as it is now for millions of years, and our people can once again enjoy stability and predictability in our home system.\n\nOur star's increased size has clear consequences for how we manage our infrastructure, and we can now make the most of these changes, exploiting its increased energetic output while maintaining a viable presence in the system."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/003cb28799e940afb381.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"infernals.2145.a","label":{"zh":"终于，我们掌握了自己的命运。","en":"At last, we control our destiny."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[{"target":"infernals.2160","kind":"delay","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"delay","delay":[{"months":"12"}],"source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:5507","hooks":["after"],"story":"event-infernals-2150"}],"source":{"file":"events/infernals_1_events.txt","line":5288},"sets":["lusus_contact_completed","situation_red_giant_ended","situation_red_giant_stabilize_the_star","starfire_cannon_unlocked"],"names":{"Target.GetStarName":{"zh":"这颗恒星","en":"the star"}}},{"id":"infernals.2160","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"危机火花","en":"A Spark Of Crisis"},"texts":[{"zh":"持续研究表明，亚空间开采站以一种奇异形式储存了巨量热能，我方[GetScientistPlural]称之为结晶熵。该设施利用热反馈循环放大能量输入。\n\n若能复制这项技术，我们将掌握前所未有的力量，虽然许多人可能认为这不自然且危险。这样可能产生大量多余热能，但如果能找到在这种条件下生存的方法，星系将成为我们的囊中之物。","en":"Ongoing study of the subspace mining station suggests that it stores massive amounts of thermal energy in an exotic form, which our [GetScientistPlural] are calling Crystallized Entropy. It leverages thermal feedback loops to magnify energy inputs.\n\nBy replicating this technology, we could learn to wield previously unimaginable power that many would deem unnatural and dangerous. Doing so may produce vast amounts of excess heat, but if we are able to find a way to thrive in such conditions, the galaxy may be ours for the taking."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/81a74378532b762f5b17.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"infernals.2160.a","label":{"zh":"深入研究。","en":"Let us investigate further."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"[GetRedgiantAlreadyHyperthermiaPickable]发现结晶熵，推动星系热症进展。","en":"[GetRedgiantAlreadyHyperthermiaPickable]Uncovers Crystallized Entropy to progress Galactic Hyperthermia."}],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"red_giant_discovered_crystallized_entropy","path":"","value":false},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_pacifist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"和平主义","en":"Pacifist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophile","value":false,"label":{"zh":"亲外主义","en":"Xenophile"}},{"type":"identity","key":"civic_hive_familiar_face","value":false,"label":{"zh":"如镜中面","en":"Familiar Face"}},{"type":"other","key":"is_galactic_emperor","arg":"yes","scope":"","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"is_galactic_custodian","arg":"yes","scope":"","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"is_subject","arg":"yes","scope":"","value":false}]],"sets":["red_giant_discovered_crystallized_entropy"]},{"key":"infernals.2160.b","label":{"zh":"该技术过于危险，不宜继续。","en":"That technology is too dangerous to pursue."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false},{"key":"infernals.2160.c","label":{"zh":"结晶熵的原始应用方式。","en":"Such primitive use of Crystallized Entropy."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"red_giant_discovered_crystallized_entropy","path":"","value":true}]]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/infernals_1_events.txt","line":5701},"alsoIn":["event-infernals-10"]},{"id":"infernals.2130","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"亚空间采矿作业","en":"Subspace Mining Operation"},"texts":[{"zh":"开采站从气态巨行星虹吸氢气，通过亚空间隧道输送至恒星外层，引发氦聚变反应，释放出过剩能量，再将能量转化为结晶熵，为站点供能。\n\n导致[event_target:situation_red_giant_target_shortterm.GetStarName]不稳定的根源在于居民未能察觉或无法修复的校准误差与设备老化。\n\n借助他们古老的技术，我们有可能将这一进程逆转，但难度极高。另一个可行的方案是诱导恒星发生新星爆发，使大量矿藏暴露出来，成为方便开采的资源。","en":"The station siphons hydrogen from a gas giant and channels it through subspace into our star's shell. The resulting helium fusion releases excess energy, which is converted into Crystallized Entropy to power the station.\n\nThe instability of [event_target:situation_red_giant_target_shortterm.GetStarName] is a result of calibration errors and equipment degradation that the inhabitants either didn't notice or didn't know how to fix. \n\nWorking with their ancient technology we can reverse the process, but it will not be easy. Alternatively, forcing our star to go nova could expose countless deposits transforming our heritage into a trove of exploitable resources."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/75335066f7180838e0ce.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"infernals.2130.a","label":{"zh":"是时候开始了。","en":"It's time to get to work."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[{"target":"infernals.2140","kind":"delay","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"delay","delay":[{"months":"24"}],"source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:4962","hooks":["immediate"],"story":"event-infernals-2150"}],"source":{"file":"events/infernals_1_events.txt","line":4949},"sets":["red_giant_controlled_lusus_station","situation_red_giant_expansion_approach4"],"names":{"event_target:situation_red_giant_target_shortterm.GetStarName":{"zh":"这颗恒星","en":"the star"}}},{"id":"infernals.2135","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"威胁终结","en":"An End to the Threat"},"texts":[{"zh":"得知我们的处境后，站内居民陷入恐慌。他们自以为在宇宙中孑然一身，从未意识到星系中还有其他物种存在。\n\n我们还没完全弄清他们究竟做了什么，他们便在懊悔之下开始自行拆除开采站，永久摧毁大部分组件。\n\n因此，控制恒星膨胀将十分困难。我们必须决定如何处理这些不稳定的外星人，并考虑是否给予他们所期望的宽恕。","en":"Upon learning of our plight, the station's inhabitants expressed alarm and dismay. They believed themselves alone, and were unaware of other species in the galaxy.\n\nIn a fit of remorse and before we truly grasped what they were doing, they began to dismantle the station, permanently destroying most of its components.\n\nAs a result, it will be difficult to control the star's expansion. And we must decide what to do with these volatile aliens, and whether to offer them the forgiveness they desire."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/a046346a4c29e40785f7.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"infernals.2135.a","label":{"zh":"收留他们并修复开采站。","en":"Take them in and salvage the station."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"在[this.GetName]生成了400 £pop£ 人口","en":"400 £pop£ Pops are created in [this.GetName]"}],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_fanatic_xenophobe","value":false,"label":{"zh":"极端排外主义","en":"Fanatic Xenophobe"}},{"type":"other","key":"is_homicidal","arg":"yes","scope":"owner","value":false}]]},{"key":"infernals.2135.b","label":{"zh":"处置他们并摧毁开采站。","en":"Dispose of them and of the station."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false},{"key":"infernals.2135.c","label":{"zh":"奴役他们并摧毁开采站。","en":"Enslave them and destroy the station."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"在[this.GetName]生成了300 £pop£ 人口","en":"300 £pop£ Pops are created in [this.GetName]"}],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"infernals.2130","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","delay":[{"days":"30"}],"source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:5134","story":"event-infernals-2150"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"allows_slavery","arg":"yes","scope":"owner","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"is_homicidal","arg":"yes","scope":"owner","value":false}]]},{"key":"infernals.2115.f","label":{"zh":"净化开采站。","en":"Purge the station."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"infernals.2130","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","delay":[{"days":"30"}],"source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:5151","story":"event-infernals-2150"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"is_homicidal","arg":"yes","scope":"owner","value":true}]]},{"key":"infernals.2115.g","label":{"zh":"吞噬他们。","en":"Eat them."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"infernals.2130","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","delay":[{"days":"30"}],"source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:5186","story":"event-infernals-2150"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"auth_hive_mind","value":true,"label":{"zh":"蜂巢思维","en":"Hive Mind"}},{"type":"identity","key":"origin_necrophage","value":true,"label":{"zh":"食尸文化","en":"Necrophage"}},{"type":"other","key":"exists","arg":"event_target:lusus_miner_station@owner","scope":"","value":false}],[{"type":"identity","key":"auth_hive_mind","value":true,"label":{"zh":"蜂巢思维","en":"Hive Mind"}},{"type":"identity","key":"origin_necrophage","value":true,"label":{"zh":"食尸文化","en":"Necrophage"}},{"type":"other","key":"exists","arg":"event_target:lusus_miner_station@owner","scope":"","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"has_trait","arg":"trait_lithoid","scope":"event_target:lusus_miner_station@owner/owner_species","value":false,"label":{"zh":"石质","en":"Lithoid"}},{"type":"other","key":"has_trait","arg":"trait_machine_unit","scope":"event_target:lusus_miner_station@owner/owner_species","value":false,"label":{"zh":"机械","en":"Machine"}},{"type":"other","key":"has_trait","arg":"trait_mechanical","scope":"event_target:lusus_miner_station@owner/owner_species","value":false,"label":{"zh":"机械体","en":"Mechanical"}}]]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/infernals_1_events.txt","line":5008},"sets":["lusus_station_destroyed","situation_red_giant_expansion_approach3"],"names":{"this.GetName":{"zh":"这艘舰船","en":"the ship"}}},{"id":"special_projects:INF_ORIGIN_RED_GIANT_BOARD_STATION","kind":"project","title":{"zh":"登陆开采站","en":"Boarding the Station"},"texts":[{"zh":"这群鲁莽的外星人正利用我们的恒星，必须立即登陆夺取控制权。","en":"These reckless aliens are exploiting our star. We must board their station immediately and take control."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/872246aedc238ff28ba5.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"infernals.2115","kind":"project","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_infernals.txt:179","hooks":["on_success"],"story":"event-infernals-2150"}],"source":{"file":"common/special_projects/00_projects_infernals.txt","line":163}},{"id":"infernals.2115","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"登陆突袭","en":"Boarding Party"},"texts":[{"zh":"我方部队已全面掌控该空间站。当地居民虽曾抵抗，但其装备简陋，且缺乏战争经验，许多人甚至尚未成年。幸存者均已被拘押。\n\n我们已着手研究如何控制那些亚空间隧道，它们似乎是一种能源开采虹吸装置。假以时日，我们或许就能解决母星系正面临的问题。","en":"Our forces have seized control of the station. The inhabitants put up some resistance, but were poorly armed and seemingly untrained in warfare. Upon closer inspection, many appeared to be juveniles. Those who were not killed have been contained.\n\nAnalysis has begun on how we can control the subspace tunnels, which appear to be some sort of energy-mining siphon. With time, we can address the situation in our home system."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/ba018acb1de7b3d46d43.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"infernals.2115.a","label":{"zh":"彻底拆毁。","en":"Demolish it."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"infernals.2121","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:4507","story":"event-infernals-2150"}],"terminal":false,"sets":["lusus_station_destroyed","situation_red_giant_expansion_approach3"],"clears":["situation_red_giant_continue_siphoning","situation_red_giant_expansion_approach1","situation_red_giant_expansion_approach2","situation_red_giant_expansion_approach4","situation_red_giant_reverse_inflation","situation_red_giant_stabilize_the_star"]},{"key":"infernals.2115.b","label":{"zh":"审问幸存者。","en":"Interrogate the survivors."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"infernals.2125","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","delay":[{"days":"20"}],"source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:4526","story":"event-infernals-2150"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_pacifist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"和平主义","en":"Pacifist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_egalitarian","value":false,"label":{"zh":"平等主义","en":"Egalitarian"}},{"type":"other","key":"is_homicidal","arg":"no","scope":"owner","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"values_others","arg":"no","scope":"owner","value":false}]]},{"key":"infernals.2115.c","label":{"zh":"奴役他们。","en":"Enslave them."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"在[this.GetName]生成了400 £pop£ 人口","en":"400 £pop£ Pops are created in [this.GetName]"}],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"infernals.2130","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","delay":[{"days":"30"}],"source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:4560","story":"event-infernals-2150"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"allows_slavery","arg":"yes","scope":"owner","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"is_homicidal","arg":"no","scope":"owner","value":false}]]},{"key":"infernals.2115.d","label":{"zh":"幸存者构成威胁，予以剿灭。","en":"The survivors are a risk. Eliminate them."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"infernals.2130","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","delay":[{"days":"30"}],"source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:4585","story":"event-infernals-2150"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"allows_purge","arg":"yes","scope":"owner","value":true}],[{"type":"other","key":"is_homicidal","arg":"yes","scope":"owner","value":true}]]},{"key":"infernals.2115.e","label":{"zh":"与幸存者对话。","en":"Speak to the survivors."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"infernals.2125","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","delay":[{"days":"15"}],"source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:4598","story":"event-infernals-2150"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_pacifist","value":true,"label":{"zh":"和平主义","en":"Pacifist"}}],[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_egalitarian","value":true,"label":{"zh":"平等主义","en":"Egalitarian"}}],[{"type":"other","key":"values_others","arg":"yes","scope":"owner","value":true}]]},{"key":"infernals.2115.f","label":{"zh":"净化开采站。","en":"Purge the station."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"infernals.2130","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","delay":[{"days":"30"}],"source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:4615","story":"event-infernals-2150"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"is_homicidal","arg":"yes","scope":"owner","value":true}]]},{"key":"infernals.2115.g","label":{"zh":"吞噬他们。","en":"Eat them."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"infernals.2130","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","delay":[{"days":"30"}],"source":"events/infernals_1_events.txt:4650","story":"event-infernals-2150"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"auth_hive_mind","value":true,"label":{"zh":"蜂巢思维","en":"Hive Mind"}},{"type":"other","key":"exists","arg":"event_target:lusus_miner_station@owner","scope":"","value":false}],[{"type":"identity","key":"auth_hive_mind","value":true,"label":{"zh":"蜂巢思维","en":"Hive Mind"}},{"type":"other","key":"exists","arg":"event_target:lusus_miner_station@owner","scope":"","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"has_trait","arg":"trait_lithoid","scope":"event_target:lusus_miner_station@owner/owner_species","value":false,"label":{"zh":"石质","en":"Lithoid"}},{"type":"other","key":"has_trait","arg":"trait_machine_unit","scope":"event_target:lusus_miner_station@owner/owner_species","value":false,"label":{"zh":"机械","en":"Machine"}},{"type":"other","key":"has_trait","arg":"trait_mechanical","scope":"event_target:lusus_miner_station@owner/owner_species","value":false,"label":{"zh":"机械体","en":"Mechanical"}}],[{"type":"identity","key":"origin_necrophage","value":true,"label":{"zh":"食尸文化","en":"Necrophage"}},{"type":"other","key":"exists","arg":"event_target:lusus_miner_station@owner","scope":"","value":false}],[{"type":"identity","key":"origin_necrophage","value":true,"label":{"zh":"食尸文化","en":"Necrophage"}},{"type":"other","key":"exists","arg":"event_target:lusus_miner_station@owner","scope":"","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"has_trait","arg":"trait_lithoid","scope":"event_target:lusus_miner_station@owner/owner_species","value":false,"label":{"zh":"石质","en":"Lithoid"}},{"type":"other","key":"has_trait","arg":"trait_machine_unit","scope":"event_target:lusus_miner_station@owner/owner_species","value":false,"label":{"zh":"机械","en":"Machine"}},{"type":"other","key":"has_trait","arg":"trait_mechanical","scope":"event_target:lusus_miner_station@owner/owner_species","value":false,"label":{"zh":"机械体","en":"Mechanical"}}]]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/infernals_1_events.txt","line":4475},"names":{"this.GetName":{"zh":"这艘舰船","en":"the ship"}}},{"id":"infernals.2121","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"外星人全数歼灭","en":"Aliens Terminated"},"texts":[{"zh":"亚空间开采站被摧毁，里面人员全部死亡。\n\n摧毁开采站引爆了某种未知能量储备介质，释放的能量通过坍塌的亚空间隧道涌入[event_target:situation_red_giant_target_shortterm.GetStarName]，致其局势急剧恶化。\n\n不过，向恒星输送氢气的过程已经停止。情况虽然糟糕，但不至于继续恶化。尽管我们可能永远无法了解此开采站的起源与设计，但至少能放心，因为这种力量永远不会落入对手手中。\n\n遗憾的是，我们暂时没有办法让[event_target:situation_red_giant_target_shortterm.GetStarName]立即复原。若想影响恒星状态，只能依靠记录还原开采站运作。","en":"The subspace mining station has been destroyed, killing everyone on board.\n\nThe destruction of the station detonated some unknown energy storage medium. The resulting energy rushed through the collapsing subspace tunnel into [event_target:situation_red_giant_target_shortterm.GetStarName], substantially worsening the situation back home.\n\nThat said, the transfer of hydrogen into our star has ceased. As bad as things may be, they will no longer worsen. While we may never know the origins or design of this station, we can at least rest easy knowing that such power will never fall to our rivals.\n\nUnfortunately, we have no immediate way to return [event_target:situation_red_giant_target_shortterm.GetStarName] to its original state. If we want to affect the star's state, we'll need to rely on our recordings to piece together what the station was doing."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/63d6f3741c750616746a.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"infernals.2121.a","label":{"zh":"清理残局。","en":"Let's clean up this mess."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/infernals_1_events.txt","line":4725},"sets":["lusus_station_destroyed","situation_red_giant_expansion_approach3"],"names":{"event_target:situation_red_giant_target_shortterm.GetStarName":{"zh":"这颗恒星","en":"the star"}},"alsoIn":["event-infernals-2120"]}]}